# Line endings: LF in the repo AND in the working tree on every OS.
# Two Lua copies must be byte-identical (rust_core include_str! vs Python read_text) -
# with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout turned one of them into CRLF and the
# "Lua bridge parity" job failed. Only Windows launchers keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary files: never touch
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.egg binary
*.bam binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
